  "description": "BeeAppie for .NET MAUI: user identity, sign-in, leaderboards, polls, announcements, support chat, analytics and crash reports. No UI and no third-party dependencies; add BeeAppie.Maui.UI for ready-made pages.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
